# MediaTek's ImsService runs in the phone UID, so its binder services are the
# phone's: mtkIms and mwis it registers itself, wfo it looks up and Wi-Fi
# calling would provide. radio_service is the type of the phone's other
# services, and radio already registers and finds those.
mtkIms                                    u:object_r:radio_service:s0
mwis                                      u:object_r:radio_service:s0
wfo                                       u:object_r:radio_service:s0
